  "kind": "statement",
  "title": "Scheme-theoretic image of a closed immersion",
  "statement": "If $i\\colon Z\\hookrightarrow Y$ is a closed immersion, then the factor map\n$i^{\\mathrm{im}}\\colon Z\\to\\operatorname{SIm}(i)$ is an isomorphism. Thus\nthe scheme-theoretic image of a closed immersion is canonically its source,\ncompatibly with the maps to $Y$.",
  "source": {
    "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-lem-nagata-sketch-closure/lemma-nagata-scheme-image-of-closed-immersion.md",
